// Copy to Signing.xcconfig (gitignored) after Apple Developer enrollment.
// Membership details on developer.apple.com/account show the 10-character Team ID.
// Replace the placeholder. Do not commit Signing.xcconfig or a real Team ID.
//
// The PhotometryTools target reads this as DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = $(APPLE_TEAM_ID).
// Until this file exists, the team stays empty and signing stays automatic.

APPLE_TEAM_ID = YOUR_APPLE_TEAM_ID
